This is the implementation of Jarvis IRL.

The goal of this project is to streamline office work and multitasking.

You will need the credentials.json file generated from signing up for GoogleAPI (put it in the sensitive directory)

There are no longer command variables needed when running the program.
It will prompt you to enter in the keys/ids it needs and save them (ENCRYPTED) in the sensitive directory.

As of V0.0.4, you will need Houndify and OpenAI keys/ids